        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ethics - Landscape and Taxonomy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Hume's observation: in arguments, people routinely move from\nstatements of fact (\"is\") to statements of value (\"ought\")\nwithout justifying the transition."
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#007",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:ethics:00-overview, git-history:ethics:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "ethics/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "ethics/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:ethics:overview",
